<title>UK: ISO details estimates for 1996/97 sugar production.</title>
<headline>ISO details estimates for 1996/97 sugar production.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a table of sugar production estimates for the world's major cane and beet producers, as forecast by the International Sugar Organization (ISO) in its latest report this week.</p>
<p>Figures are in millions of tonnes, raw value.</p>
<p>COUNTRY		   1996/97		  1995/96</p>
<p>Australia		   5.80		     5.35</p>
<p>Brazil		     13.50		    14.53</p>
<p>China			 7.10		     6.79</p>
<p>Cuba			  5.05		     4.64</p>
<p>European Union	   17.20		    16.95</p>
<p>India			16.30		    17.67</p>
<p>Russia			1.90		     2.18</p>
<p>Thailand		    6.63		     6.38</p>
<p>Ukraine		     3.03		     3.90</p>
<p>WORLD TOTAL	     123.49		   123.95</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
